    title: "How to systematically generate Google reviews from med spa patients (without awkward asking)",
    excerpt: "Practices with 100+ reviews and a 4.8+ rating dominate local search. Here is how to automate review generation through your loyalty program.",
    category: "Growth", readTime: "7 min read",
